  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing food security, rural incomes, and sustainable farming in Bolivia&apos;s North Amazon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">El Instituto Para el Hombre, Agricultura y Ecologa (IPHAE) will expand its agroforestry program to more communities on the Amazon in the Alto Beni and Pando and offer representatives of 700 families training in the production, processing and marketing of asai, majo and cacao as well as opportunities to participate in farmer- to-farmer exchanges and dissemination of results.</narrative>
  </description>
